counterfactuals.output:
An image display apparatus comprising:

a threshold setting unit configured to change an intensity threshold for image data;

a display control unit configured to display, among pixels included in the image data, pixels having intensity values exceeding the intensity threshold;

a region selection unit configured to receive selection of one or more regions in an image being displayed; and

a threshold fixing unit configured to fix, for the selected one or more regions, the intensity threshold being set at a time of the selection,

wherein the display control unit is configured to display pixels in the selected one or more regions based on the fixed intensity threshold, and to continue display of pixels in regions other than the selected one or more regions based on a currently changed intensity threshold.

An image processing device comprising:

an image acquisition unit configured to acquire image data representing an image;

a threshold changing unit configured to change an intensity threshold used for extracting pixels or points from the image data;

a display control unit configured to cause a display unit to display, in the image, points or pixels having intensity values satisfying the intensity threshold changed by the threshold changing unit;

a region designation receiving unit configured to receive, from a user, designation of one or more regions in the image displayed by the display unit;

a threshold fixing unit configured to fix, for each of the one or more regions designated by the user, an intensity threshold corresponding to the region; and

a display-condition control unit configured to separately control a display condition for points or pixels located inside the one or more designated regions and a display condition for points or pixels located outside the one or more designated regions,

wherein the display control unit is configured to display the points or pixels satisfying the fixed intensity threshold within each corresponding designated region independently from points or pixels outside the designated region.
